                                                "sense_id": "0267717c-0950-3e8a-952d-d1d8ebe1f6f9",
                                                "text": "Foker discharged a prodigious bouquet at her, and even Smirke made a feeble shy with a rose, and blushed dreadfully when it fell into the pit"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05132ed3-786d-4807-8e21-5d3cf35847ab",
                                                "sense_id": "0267717c-0950-3e8a-952d-d1d8ebe1f6f9",
                                                "text": "If Lord Brougham gets a stone in his hand, he must, it seems, have a shy at somebody."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6faa06b-9a04-4f4d-880d-2cb64372dbb2",
                                                "sense_id": "0267717c-0950-3e8a-952d-d1d8ebe1f6f9",
                                                "text": "The game had started. A man was chasing the ball, it went out for a shy."
